        "params": {
            "name": "char_1505_frstar_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "Go... ahead."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "I think your father really loves you.",
            "values": "1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "Just like you remember your birth parents dying for you.",
            "values": "1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "You remember clearly all that your father did for you.",
            "values": "1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1505_frstar_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "........"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "How could I not know? It's just, he's going to outlive me."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "How much better it would have been if he had never adopted me. That way, he wouldn't have to feel all the pain I've brought him."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "He's suffered so much...."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "It is because he has suffered so much that he cherishes you.",
            "values": "1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1505_frstar_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "Hehehe...."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "...Doctor."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "I can call you that, can't I?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "Doctor of Rhodes Island, choices just might be meaningless, in this world."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "Even so, even if the outcome makes no difference.... I do want to choose for myself. I made my choice."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "With my own hands.... To take the fruit of the seeds I have sown."
    },
    {
        "text": "FrostNova's fingers grope at your face ."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "Your fingers... are warm?",
            "values": "1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1505_frstar_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "Strange. Your face... is cold."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "My body temperature.... Is not so low anymore?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "Yes. Your symptoms are gone.;........;You're warm, FrostNova",
            "values": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_1505_frstar_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "I can finally touch someone... before I die."
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "FrostNova, Amiya and I want you to join Rhodes Island.",
            "values": "1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "Do I really deserve that?"
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "If you just die, here and now, you won't have a chance to right your wrongs.",
            "values": "1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "...It would be rude not to give a response."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "Tell Amiya, Dr. {@nickname}...."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova",
        "text": "In this world, a single person is worthless."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "image",
        "params": {
